Add an initial Dermux bottom keybar skeleton for mobile web sessions.

This patch introduces:
1. Fixed bottom keybar host rendered from `CodeServerClient`.
2. Command palette toggle command.
3. Dynamic workbench bottom inset and safe-area-aware CSS.

